[{"title":"戏赠刘公子","author":"史谨","text":"我挂朝冠事远游，君居建业近瀛洲。\n朱颜不作麒麟楦，白日都消燕子楼。\n云锁涧松迷鹤睡，雨添春水带花流。\n今朝已息天台念，仙籍无人肯见收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48300,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沧浪清玩亭","author":"史谨","text":"沧浪亭子万松西，路绕汀沙接翠微。\n向属巢由为地主，至今泉石有光辉。\n公馀拄笏闻猿啸，日暮钩帘看鹤归。\n多少白头名利客，经过犹未解征衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48301,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送魏御史","author":"史谨","text":"北上金台去路遥，车轮齐动马萧萧。\n霜飞豹尾威严肃，山接乌桓影动摇。\n执简夜看青塞月，入班朝侍紫宸朝。\n想回江左观风处，揽辔重过白下桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48302,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋冰中塔影","author":"史谨","text":"帝尧仁德被江湖，冰结祯祥似画图。\n云母屏中藏世界，水晶宫里见浮屠。\n黄金作范终难铸，白璧如山孰敢沽。\n多少苍生共瞻仰，声回银汉动山呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48303,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友分得采石夜月","author":"史谨","text":"蛾眉亭外月初高，采石江头夜泬寥。\n万顷金波迷宿鹭，数声铁笛舞潜蛟。\n仙人跨鲤应难捉，使客乘槎或可招。\n君去定知重玩赏，不愁霜露袭征袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48304,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽蒋静学院判","author":"史谨","text":"郭隗台边海子濆，丹房寂寂锁秋云。\n报君未遂生前志，归葬重承死后恩。\n墓夹松楸深雨露，名因赋颂满乾坤。\n尚遗三径钟山下，忍听仙禽唳夕曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48305,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别陆伯瞻","author":"史谨","text":"吕公矶畔汉江东，偶值云间陆士龙。\n海上几年推独步，天涯今日又相逢。\n江枫换色秋容老，山雨催诗别兴浓。\n我向淮南君适楚，夕阳回首隔千峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48306,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王羽士山房壁","author":"史谨","text":"夹道松阴晓正浓，松间倚杖立东风。\n静观天地元无我，不怕羲和善御龙。\n万壑暗云芝草绿，一帘春雨杏花红。\n与君就觅陶弘景，知在三茅第几峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48307,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送杨参政之广东","author":"史谨","text":"身辞玉仗下青霄，远赴羊城不惮劳。\n囊受赐金轻陆贾，文鸣当世法仪曹。\n驿藏杨柳蛮烟合，路入梅花庾岭高。\n多少苍生沾化雨，南溟从此息波涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48308,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈进士","author":"史谨","text":"匹马嘶寒出万山，冶城北上翠孱颜。\n烟霞故旧无多外，落日猿声万木间。\n白帝祠荒迷塞草，金牛路远接秦关。\n谁知驴背能诗客，献赋曾趋玉笋班。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48309,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜡梅","author":"史谨","text":"踪迹平生远市朝，暗香时动郁金袍。\n梦回羌管风光别，身近罗浮地位高。\n不见翠禽啼月下，却疑黄蝶缀林梢。\n知名虽有孤山客，未肯相过结淡交。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48310,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月蚀","author":"史谨","text":"出海银蟾一鉴圆，天狼俄扰失婵娟。\n耳交钟鼓心尤切，轮缺山河影渐偏。\n玉兔无声閒杵臼，素娥潜迹渺云烟。\n扫除喜遇飞廉至，依旧清光万古悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48311,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送邓道录致仕还乡","author":"史谨","text":"远辞玉仗下青霄，千里还家岂惮劳。\n暗叱风雷随剑起，旧栽松桂入云高。\n榴皮画鹤犹能舞，羽扇为舟不用操。\n却笑红尘来往客，百年生死一鸿毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48312,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢克一蒋院判送菊","author":"史谨","text":"团团月朵间鹅黄，嫩蕊疏葩次第芳。\n远辱高情怜白首，平分秋色过丹房。\n花前暂舞嗟寒蝶，林下相依有拒霜。\n几度醉扶藜杖看，只疑门径是柴桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48313,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题昌阳书舍","author":"史谨","text":"绕舍新栽九节蒲，凉阴覆幔雨晴初。\n引年不用松乔术，明目宜精孔孟书。\n叶长凤毛深雨露，根蟠虬脊重璠玙。\n我来笑指庭交翠，疑是濂溪旧隐居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48314,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归田","author":"史谨","text":"拂袖归来梦始安，貂裘敝尽雪盈冠。\n一林柿叶供书翰，两部蛙声不属官。\n佳境渐从閒处入，老怀应比旧时宽。\n山房酿得松花酒，长供渔樵作淡欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48315,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送金御史","author":"史谨","text":"九载乌台著豸冠，忽看报政上长安。\n鹏程远奋三千里，骥足终归十二闲。\n自有风霜随绣斧，岂无礼乐对金銮。\n到家想近黄花节，登遍秦淮醉里山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48316,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石城霁雪送李进士","author":"史谨","text":"春意初回季子裘，又携行李上神州。\n群鸡唱晓辞官舍，疋马嘶寒过石头。\n云散白衣迷粉堞，山排玉剑隐谯楼。\n城边不见青青柳，聊赠梅花慰别愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48317,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈叔振之安南","author":"史谨","text":"路入三湘过五溪，远陪上将伐雕题。\n旌旗蔽野三军肃，鼓角连营万马嘶。\n洗涤河山归大统，宣扬威信服群黎。\n明年奏凯东还日，处处春风越鸟啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48318,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹雪轩","author":"史谨","text":"一尘不动昼冥冥，万竹堆琼绕四横。\n恍若梨云迷嶰谷，还疑柳絮暗柯亭。\n月明不见青鸾影，风起微闻玉佩声。\n何日杖藜容直造，六花堆里扣柴扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48319,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日寓意","author":"史谨","text":"试捲湘帘雪已晴，北风犹作怒涛声。\n池冰映日铺云母，檐溜乘寒结水精。\n归老已无霄汉志，择交因见死生情。\n扶筇起傍梅花立，数萼含香尚未倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48320,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松窗听雪卷","author":"史谨","text":"六出随风散紫冥，庭前俄失万松青。\n疏帘堕影觉微响，落叶有声无此清。\n万虑已空心似水，一尘不染色铺琼。\n晚来听罢呼童扫，要把长镵取茯苓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48321,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送徐先生","author":"史谨","text":"一幅征帆挂柳阴，客边送客忍分襟。\n凤孤暂失三山侣，骥老终存万里心。\n汀卧白鸥知浪静，花飞红雨觉春深。\n别来使我添惆怅，落日哀猿几处吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48322,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送金生丧母还乡","author":"史谨","text":"千里家山抱恨还，落梅如雪点征鞍。\n慈亲异世音容远，孤子何时泪血乾。\n鲤跃冰花思泽冻，乌啼宰木惨霜寒。\n想应去设墦间祭，石上新铭不忍看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48323,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省庵","author":"史谨","text":"高堂搆在赤城西，谁识先生独坐时。\n一念不欺天地合，八窗长静薜萝垂。\n閒中光景知难驻，就里工夫莫放迟。\n此意了然应自得，笑看庭草翠离离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48324,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宴甘氏梅雪轩","author":"史谨","text":"朝来领鹤访林逋，六出飞琼满径铺。\n玉树有花春寂寞，碧窗无影画模糊。\n眼中顿觉添奇观，席上还堪著老夫。\n元是水晶宫里客，置身今夕在冰壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48325,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡湘江","author":"史谨","text":"远乘一舸渡江乡，风景萧萧带夕阳。\n古树有巢鸠借宿，野花无主蝶偷香。\n惊心忽见山排戟，留客时闻燕语樯。\n惆怅骚魂招不得，空依芦苇望三湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48326,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题晚翠堂","author":"史谨","text":"高堂迢递万松间，郁郁虬枝绕画阑。\n要与林泉留胜概，不随蒲柳共凋残。\n云归自锁巢间鹤，竹近常闻月下鸾。\n尽日涛声来树杪，无边诗思入毫端。\n花飘金粉香犹湿，叶堕苍髯露未乾。\n扫径每迟佳客至，斸苓常寄老夫餐。\n罗浮仙子应同操，句曲真人拟挂冠。\n更爱冰霜摇落后，独留黛色倚高寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48327,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰竹图","author":"史谨","text":"采采石上兰，萧萧水边竹。\n各抱夷齐心，清风激流俗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48328,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"史谨","text":"窗户昼萧森，空阶凝绿阴。\n不缘冰雪里，焉识岁寒心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48329,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题玩月仕女","author":"史谨","text":"独立长门里，徘徊无所亲。\n可怜前殿月，不照后宫人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48330,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观花有感","author":"史谨","text":"涧畔花无数，荣枯各有时。\n先开复先谢，莫羡向阳枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48331,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雪景","author":"史谨","text":"寒树老空山，云根碧藓斑。\n野船才近岸，疑向剡溪边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48332,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"史谨","text":"古树云烟合，遥山紫翠浮。\n白头林下客，应伴赤松游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48333,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸳鸯图","author":"史谨","text":"头白两文禽，和鸣多好音。\n韩朋坟上树，双宿到如今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48334,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"史谨","text":"林壑昼冥冥，松萝覆野亭。\n一尘飞不到，门外数峰青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48335,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春山行乐图","author":"史谨","text":"四海无波六合清，诸公乘暇乐升平。\n杏花村外东风里，醉拂吟鞭并辔行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48336,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉天殿朝回","author":"史谨","text":"春风淡荡御烟微，玉佩成行柳下归。\n共浴恩波还共散，紫薇花下换朝衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48337,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓望钟山","author":"史谨","text":"势蟠龙虎翠高低，树色苍苍接凤池。\n宿雾渐消云散尽，金乌飞上万年枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48338,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过虎踞关","author":"史谨","text":"关路盘盘绕翠微，岩花涧草竞春辉。\n晚来醉拂吟鞭过，山气濛濛欲染衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48339,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题捕鱼图","author":"史谨","text":"罢钓归来日已昏，荻花吹雪暗江村。\n此生不是甘贫贱，留得清风遗子孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48340,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送邓太守","author":"史谨","text":"典郡曾为百里侯，中心元只慕伊周。\n今朝五马西南去，重使三苗识邓攸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48341,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日试笔","author":"史谨","text":"苍苍初日照楼台，元气淋漓遍九垓。\n不是梅花露消息，人间何处识春来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48342,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过瀼西","author":"史谨","text":"天涯春尽强提携，百丈牵江过瀼西。\n谁识少陵忧国恨，东风处处杜鹃啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48343,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过巫山","author":"史谨","text":"一剑长悬万里身，偶经巫峡又逢春。\n路傍多少娉婷女，谁是襄王梦里人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48344,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白帝城晚眺","author":"史谨","text":"城郭荒凉秋气深，江山如画一登临。\n中原自有刘文叔，应笑公孙错用心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48345,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨葡萄","author":"史谨","text":"谁写秋风月下枝，摩挲醉墨尚淋漓。\n白头常侍心中事，只有凉州刺史知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48346,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋夜对月","author":"史谨","text":"一池树影压青天，万籁无声月正圆。\n多少词臣争折桂，不知谁在郤诜先。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48347,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣和金桃鹦鹉图","author":"史谨","text":"叶底金桃似弹悬，陇禽双啄味初全。\n披图自识宣和笔，流落人间几百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48348,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝便面","author":"史谨","text":"广寒宫里碧琅玕，叶叶清风起暮寒。\n自有凌霜高节在，敲门未许俗人看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48349,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得家书","author":"史谨","text":"万里来从青海头，开封未读泪先流。\n书中不尽心中事，只恐看时我更愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48350,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题南楚才妻写容寄夫图","author":"史谨","text":"欲整云鬟意转慵，却调花露写芳容。\n慇勤寄与天涯客，休作阳台梦里逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48351,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题琅邪山图","author":"史谨","text":"绿树阴阴石径斜，诸峰罗立带琅邪。\n云深亭观知多少，谁是庐陵太守家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48352,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题马图","author":"史谨","text":"猛气如云不受羁，时清放牧华山西。\n自怜今日无人顾，空向奚奴振鬣嘶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48353,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈士常","author":"史谨","text":"萧萧行李出边城，曙色初分柳外亭。\n今日送君翻愧我，剑锋磨尽尚飘零。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48354,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客夜","author":"史谨","text":"雁叫寒空月满江，无边乡思正难降。\n西风不待人驱遣，又送秋声入夜窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48355,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"史谨","text":"平湖雨过水云腥，暑气全消□□亭。\n野老放船何处去，不知山色上衣青。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48356,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日","author":"史谨","text":"乌帽笼头发似银，厌骑羸马踏红尘。\n今朝又醉秦淮酒，共插黄花少故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48357,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘潭县","author":"史谨","text":"石田茅屋路东西，乘兴还堪一杖藜。\n云气忽来山不见，满林春雨鹧鸪啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48358,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄陵庙阻风","author":"史谨","text":"黄沙捲雾暗前滩，风吼雷声控百蛮。\n此处波涛原自异，祖龙何必赭其山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48359,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日 其一","author":"史谨","text":"病骨秋来似冻蝇，好山空忆去年登。\n今朝对景成惆怅，勉上西楼第一层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48360,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日 其二","author":"史谨","text":"碧阑干外楚江滨，一片秋光雨后新。\n多少登高林下客，不知谁是去年人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48361,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题碧桃锦鸠图","author":"史谨","text":"一枝和露倚琅玕，髣髴玄都雪后看。\n何处飞来双野鸟，花间唤雨立春寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48362,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓过洞庭湖","author":"史谨","text":"渺渺湖光接素秋，雁声嘹呖满汀洲。\n孤舟唤醒还家梦，枫叶芦花一片愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48363,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日瞿塘观竞渡","author":"史谨","text":"龙舟一叶戏苍茫，画楫齐操忽怒泷。\n俄顷翻身葬鱼腹，醉魂惭诉汨罗江。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48364,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻猿","author":"史谨","text":"几处空山啸月明，不堪闻过两三声。\n谁知万里南迁客，一夜孤舟梦不成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48365,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻子规","author":"史谨","text":"声声何苦劝人归，不管行人听转悲。\n十二峰前云树里，几番啼到月明时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48366,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王真人雪中惠鹅","author":"史谨","text":"雪满千山却负期，只缘尘事苦相羁。\n扣门忽辱羲禽赠，来自山阴洗墨池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48367,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小孤山","author":"史谨","text":"江汉东来第一关，孤高如剑许猿攀。\n云深知有仙娥庙，落日钟声出半山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48368,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳台","author":"史谨","text":"南控衡庐北剑关，千年遗迹后人攀。\n不知梦里人何处，为雨为云过别山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48369,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夔府","author":"史谨","text":"险过咸阳百二关，扪萝犹忆旧时攀。\n却怜井底公孙述，虚筑层城据此山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48370,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪山关","author":"史谨","text":"羸骖忆度雪山关，鸟道穿云次第攀。\n莫怪阮生曾恸哭，前程犹有万重山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48371,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题明妃出塞图","author":"史谨","text":"琵琶声断雪纷纷，三月龙沙不见春。\n回首汉宫云一片，承恩今日是何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48372,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题太真吹笛图","author":"史谨","text":"日色斜明五凤楼，阿环吹笛按凉州。\n馀音杳逐行云去，散作开元天下愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48373,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]